      "value": "@{5bd37310bd2375659769bb32|full_name}: Why are you so adamant on denying a system that 46 other people have voted for on being a feature? I simply suggested it because it's unreasonable to have to play a game of guess every time a friend changes their name and then never mentions it to you or puts it in their status and on top of that you haven't even noticed my other comment about having a setting to disable it, that way it never logs anything relating to your name at all. It would literally just be a system that's only there if YOU want it. If you don't then turn it off by hitting a simple button.",
