      "value": "@{5bd37310bd2375659769bb32|full_name}: It feels more like you're just running on a vendetta or something. I don't know what your history is to be against something useful like this, nor do I care to. Perhaps if you offer something more concrete, as opposed to 'I don't want it because drama' (let's be honest, most people aren't changing their display name for such a reason), then we can potentially agree why it would not be a desirable feature.\n\nEdit: By the way, I should also mention that the official site ALREADY does this functionality when visiting a person's profile page, so you're not really hiding from anyone.",
