      "value": "I recently changed my name and vrchat reset it back because it violated the rules. It's a name. I've seen people have things like my name before. I want a refund on my name to at least change it to match my friend. Because this is just stupid for you to do that and make me have to wait a whole norther 90 days over a stupid user.",
