  "details": "A request by another VRChat Discord member, Raelin512. They have given me the go to type out their request out for the canny.\n\n\"Since we can change our names now I'd like to suggest a \"previous names\" line on the menu when you open the information about your friends. There's enough room to put it right underneath the picture of their avatar and it'll help with people being removed simply because people forget who they are after they change their name.\"\n\nIf I had any input on this, I would say I would rather have a separate button when I click a user titled \"Other aliases\" or something like that. Everything else they said lines up with what I think of why I think this is a good idea.",
